    "hints": [
      "Which parenthetical expression means 'apparently/it seems' and signals that the speaker is making an inference?"
    ],
    "explanations": [
      "'По-видимому' (apparently/it seems) is an inference parenthetical marking uncertain knowledge. 'Конечно' (of course) expresses certainty, 'к счастью' (fortunately) is emotional, and 'безусловно' (undoubtedly) is emphatic certainty; none express inference."
